            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "99. A Casual employee who is regularly assigned a predetermined work schedule shall be reclassified to either Short-Hour, Temporary or Regular status and service credit for the purpose of benefit accrual shall be the effective date of reclassification to Regular status. Written posting or notification of one (1) week constitutes a predetermined work schedule.",
